+        """Patch 0923: (ids, [(char, token index) of each literal]) from fastokens, or None to use the HF path.
+
+        The accepted profile extracts added tokens leftmost-longest before BPE, so the k-th literal id in ``ids`` is
+        the k-th non-overlapping match of ``self.pattern`` (longest alternative first) in ``tail``. Any disagreement
+        (count, id or content) returns None, and the caller re-encodes with HF tokenizers' offsets."""
